# What time is it in Russian: который час?
subtitle: "Ask the time in Russian, hear why the hour is час, часа́ or часо́в after its number, and say at seven: в семь часо́в."
thumb: "band \"Three words for one hour\" note \"час · часа́ · часо́в\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Where are you going in Russian: куда?","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/27-russian-going.cast"}

