    card title "What time is it?"

A: How do you ask the time in Russian, and understand the answer?
    draw clk_face clk_n12 clk_n3 clk_n6 clk_n9 clk_n1 clk_n2 clk_n4 clk_n5 clk_n7 clk_n8 clk_n10 clk_n11 clk_min clk_hr clk_pin

B: Кото́рый час?
    draw q1

A: Word for word: which hour? Кото́рый is which, and час is hour.
    draw q1g

B: Ско́лько вре́мени?
    draw q2

A: Or: how much time? Both are everyday; вре́мени is a form of вре́мя, time.
    draw q2g

    erase qs

B: Сейча́с час.
    move clk_hr rotate -30 pivot.anchor start duration 0.9

    draw ph1

A: It's one o'clock now. Сейча́с means now, and for one, Russians usually drop оди́н and say just час.
    draw d1 h1

    erase ph1

B: Сейча́с два часа́.
    move clk_hr rotate -30 pivot.anchor start duration 0.9

    draw ph2

A: At two, the word for hour takes an а: часа́, stressed at the end.
    draw d2 h2

    erase ph2

B: Три часа́.
    move clk_hr rotate -30 pivot.anchor start duration 0.7

    hide d2

    show d234

B: Четы́ре часа́.
    move clk_hr rotate -30 pivot.anchor start duration 0.7

    move clk_hr rotate -30 pivot.anchor start duration 0.7

B: Сейча́с пять часо́в.
    draw ph5

A: Two, three and four keep the а, but at five (@draw d3 h3@) it changes to ов, часо́в, and that lasts all the way to twelve.

A: You've met this pattern at the market: оди́н рубль, два рубля́, пять рубле́й.
    draw rubcol

    erase d1 d234 d3

A: Just like the rouble, the number's  (@draw L1 L2 L3@)last word picks the ending: оди́н, then два, три or четы́ре, then anything else.

    erase ph5

    move clk_hr rotate -60 pivot.anchor start duration 0.9

B: В семь часо́в.
    draw ph7

A: To say at a time, put в in front: в семь часо́в, at seven o'clock.
    highlight ph7 part ^В effect circle color #3d3833

    erase ph7

    move clk_hr rotate -120 pivot.anchor start duration 1.8

    draw ph11

    ask "Which word goes with оди́ннадцать? Tap it." choose ["h1","h2","h3"] answer h3 stage own voice a
        right: Оди́ннадцать часо́в: it ends in дцать, like every teen, so it takes ов.
        wrong: Look at how eleven ends: дцать, not оди́н.

    erase pageA

A: That last word matters on a train timetable too, where nine at night is 21:00.
    draw board board_t train

B: Два́дцать оди́н час.
    draw w21

A: Its last word is оди́н, so it's час again, even after twenty.
    highlight w21 part "оди́н час" effect underline color #3d3833

    erase pageB

A: Now I ask Masha the time, and when dinner is.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name sclk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: У́жин is dinner, and в семь часо́в answers когда́: at seven.
    blocking false

    highlight talk_3_words part у́жин color #f2c14e duration 1.2

    move sclk_hr rotate -30 pivot.anchor start duration 1

    highlight talk_4_words color #f2c14e duration 1.6

    erase talk sclk

    hide speakers

    draw tclk

    quiz "What time is it? Pick one." reveal.text "три часа́" reveal.at.x 560 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, from memory, then your score.
        right: Three is one of two to four, so it's часа́.
        wrong: Two, three and four share one ending.
        * три час
        + три часа́
        * три часо́в

    erase question_2_stamp

    hide tclk

    ask "Ask the time the 'which hour' way. Type it in Russian." answer ["который час","который час?"] store q2 default "который час" reveal.text "Кото́рый час?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 80 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Кото́рый час: which hour.
        wrong: Two words: which, then hour.

    erase question_3_stamp

    show tclk

    move tclk_hr rotate 60 pivot.anchor start duration 0.8

    quiz "What time is it now? Pick one." reveal.text "Сейча́с час." reveal.at.x 560 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Just час: for one o'clock, оди́н is dropped.
        wrong: One o'clock needs only one word.
        * оди́н часо́в
        + час
        * оди́н часа́

    erase question_4_stamp

    hide tclk

    quiz "Dinner is at eight. Pick the Russian." reveal.text "у́жин в 8:00" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 90 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: В for at, and часо́в after eight.
        wrong: You need at, and eight is five or more.
        + У́жин в во́семь часо́в.
        * У́жин во́семь часа́.
        * У́жин в во́семь час.

    erase question_5_stamp

    quiz "A timetable says 22:00. Pick the Russian." reveal.text "22:00 = два́дцать два часа́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: The last word is два, so часа́, even after twenty.
        wrong: Look at the last word of the number.
        * два́дцать два часо́в
        * два́дцать два час
        + два́дцать два часа́

    erase question_6_stamp

    show L1 h1 L2 h2 L3 h3 b1 b2 b3 bhead ph7

    group eclk members ["eclk_face","eclk_n1","eclk_n2","eclk_n3","eclk_n4","eclk_n5","eclk_n6","eclk_n7","eclk_n8","eclk_n9","eclk_n10","eclk_n11","eclk_n12","eclk_min","eclk_hr","eclk_pin"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So час changes with its number: час after one, часа́ after two to four, часо́в from five on, and в turns it into at.
    blocking false

    highlight h1 color #f2c14e duration 1.3

    highlight h2 color #f2c14e duration 1.3

    highlight h3 color #f2c14e duration 1.3

    highlight ph7 part ^В effect circle color #3d3833 duration 1.4

    hide L1 h1 L2 h2 L3 h3 b1 b2 b3 bhead ph7

B: Кото́рый час? Сейча́с семь часо́в: у́жин! Next time: where are you going? Пока́!
    text e_ph "Сейча́с семь часо́в." #3d3833 say true say_voice b colors {"ов$":"#2a7f7f"} x 700 y 450 font_size 52
    icon e_food size 130 set twemoji x 700 y 300 or ["spaghetti"] icon_look picture of "pot of food"
    parallel true

